Package: parkeze-console
Version: @VERSION@-@BUILD@
Depends: uhttpd, uhttpd-mod-ucode, ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, ucode-mod-ubus, ucode-mod-digest, openssl-util, px5g-mbedtls, umdns
Source: parkeze
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: The Parkeze gateway console.
 A single-page web interface and its ucode API, replacing LuCI. Local
 authentication, parkeze.net SSO handoff, and offline recovery via signed
 challenge-response.
